(Why Chosen: As a student, I've seen how much time and money goes into buying basic items from multiple shops,) Tj
T* (and how hard it is to find fairly priced second-hand textbooks. Hostel students often depend on a few nearby) Tj
T* (stores with limited stock. The growth of quick-commerce and online marketplaces shows people want) Tj
T* (convenience, and I saw a gap for a marketplace built specifically around student needs and budgets.) Tj
