(Venture Idea: UniMart is a student-focused online marketplace that helps college students buy affordable and) Tj
T* (useful products in one place. Students can find stationery, textbooks, hostel essentials, accessories, snacks and) Tj
T* (other daily-use items without having to visit multiple shops. UniMart focuses on convenience, affordability and) Tj
T* (quick access for students. It can also allow students to sell or exchange products they no longer need, creating a) Tj
T* (simple student-to-student marketplace within the college community.) Tj
